{"id":124752475296157,"name":"Street Code","desc":"🌟 Welcome to Code Street! 🌟\nDive into New Yolk—a city where YOU choose your destiny!\n\n🔥 Newbie to Legend\nStart as a fresh-faced rookie on the streets. Will you be a gangster 😈 causing chaos, or a chill civilian 😎 vibing in penthouses? Your choices = your rep!\n\n🗺️ Explore New Yolk’s neon skyscrapers, sketchy alleys, and lit hangouts!\n\n💸 GET THAT BAG\nRob banks 💰, race supercars 🏎️, own mega-mansions—live like a BOSS!\n\n🚨Outsmart cops 🚔 with wacky gadgets\n\n🔫 CRAZY WEAPONS\nBattle gangs using SICK Guitar Blaster🎸 or Kawaii Wing Shooter✨  (yes, really!)\n\n💼Switch roles ANYTIME: you can be police officer, a mom, a baby or delivery...Go wild!\n\nTags: Hood, Street Life, Lootbox, Unboxing, Metro, Hangout, RP, Roleplay","path":"/game/124752475296157-street-code","slug":"124752475296157-street-code","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/605a25935cc7259a1720e301a2dee2a35959a570d22d828e31a40d2da90c8178.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b97c4e4322c3d139211978d685ee5fdf/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":160,"visitor":18817367,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-07-18T20:51:29.329Z","creator":{"name":"Century Operators","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"687ab3d1f3667103161c46e4","title":"Spawn Paid Cars","game":{"_id":"687ab3d1f3667103161c46d7","gameId":124752475296157,"name":"Street Code","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/605a25935cc7259a1720e301a2dee2a35959a570d22d828e31a40d2da90c8178.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b97c4e4322c3d139211978d685ee5fdf/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"124752475296157-street-code","path":"/game/124752475296157-street-code","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/605a25935cc7259a1720e301a2dee2a35959a570d22d828e31a40d2da90c8178.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b97c4e4322c3d139211978d685ee5fdf/150/150/Image/Png/